1
00:00:01,320 --> 00:00:03,903
Evening, Rae!
The usual!

2
00:00:03,943 --> 00:00:05,446
We're out.

3
00:00:05,486 --> 00:00:06,930
...Out?

4
00:00:07,700 --> 00:00:11,014
We have oat milk!
Almond milk! Moon milk!

5
00:00:11,054 --> 00:00:15,755
Nine years.
Same milk. Every night.

6
00:00:15,795 --> 00:00:17,265
Eleven.

7
00:00:17,435 --> 00:00:22,684
Great news! Milk is now a subscription!
Only ninety-nine ninety-nine a month!

8
00:00:22,724 --> 00:00:25,370
Noooo...

9
00:00:26,440 --> 00:00:29,190
Relax. I hid one.

10
00:00:29,560 --> 00:00:32,867
Rae...
you DO care!

11
00:00:32,907 --> 00:00:35,788
You leave a trail
when you cry.
